  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& I=\\int_0^\\pi e^{\\cos ^2 x} \\cos ^3(2 n+1) x d x, n \\in Z \\ldots(1) \\\\\n& =\\int_0^\\pi e^{\\cos ^2(\\pi-x)} \\cos ^3[(2 n+1)(\\pi-x)] d x\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nUsing \\(\\int_0^a f(x) d x=\\int_0^a f(a-x) d x\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\therefore I=\\int_0^\\pi e^{\\cos ^2 x} \\cos ^3[(2 n+1) \\pi-(2 n+1) x] d x \\\\\n& I=\\int_0^\\pi-e^{\\cos ^2 x} \\cos ^3(2 n+1) x d x \\ldots \\text { (2) }\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nAdding (1) and (2) we get\n\\(21=0 \\Rightarrow 1=0\\)",
